<title>USA: Noland stake held by New York investor.</title>
<headline>Noland stake held by New York investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marvin Schwartz, a New York investor, said Friday he holds a 5.26 percent stake in Noland Co or 194,899 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Schwartz said his latest transactions include the purchase of 10,000 common shares bought between Oct 10 and Oct 16 at a price of $21 per share.</p>
<p>Schwartz bought the shares for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
